    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "PRADA's Cleo bag has just been reissued in an \"East-West\" horizontal silhouette, retaining the signature crescent shape and slim, angled base while the elongated, side-to-side proportions lend it a more modern attitude. It comes in two versions: one Cleo is crafted from black-and-white spotted calf hair, its plush natural bristle texture and Dalmatian print making the bag as playful and charming as a little pet; the other is made from smooth, hard-wearing Spazzolato calf leather in pure white with black edge painting, for a distinctly avant-garde look.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
