      "text": "This Le City motorcycle bag comes from Balenciaga's Winter 26 men's collection. The body is made from gray knit fabric and embroidered with a frayed-edge logo motif that evokes the feel of casual sportswear. Tan polished lambskin frames the bag and forms the handles and corners, adding refined detail and giving the piece an overall retro-athletic character.",
